# The only Docker build here is examples/sidecar's, and it needs only these. Without
# this file every build would send .venv and .claude/worktrees to the daemon.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src
!examples/sidecar
# Nothing secret or local inside what is let in either: a CA or key, an env file, irimi's state
# (`$IRIMI_HOME` pointed into the tree), the SQLite file the app writes when run bare, caches.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.irimi
**/*.sqlite3
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
